{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "Fixed-profile Node 1 topic response",
  "description": "Stage 1 for one fixed audience and one fixed seven-facet tag bundle. Every brief must preserve both inputs and its title must be a displayable question. Cross-field compatibility rules are defined by the taxonomy catalog and runtime validator.",
